    detail:
      "## Choose the protocol\n| Tool | Protocol | Base URL |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| OpenAI SDK, Cursor, Cline, Chatbox | Chat completions | Playground gateway root |\n| Codex CLI | Responses | Playground gateway root |\n| Claude Code | Messages | Root without /v1 |\n| OpenCode and agent frameworks | Selected adapter | Check provider settings |\n\nEach tool has a dedicated guide in the directory. XHub has no third-party automatic setup installer. A successful model list does not verify every model capability.",
